The "I’m not a wimp and here’s my proof" conduct patch
This patch determines if you’ve ever caused a conflict, instantly killed a 
monster 
or ever wore an amulet of lifesaving as (separate) conducts. 
Now see if you can ascend...

NOTE: This will break save game compatibility.

Breaking conflict
Causing a non-tame monster to attack another non-tame monster
Causing a peaceful monster to attack you


Breaking instadeath:
Killing a monster with a wand of death, finger of death or disintegration 
ray
Killing a monster by applying a wand of death
Stoning a monster
Stoning Medusa by reflection
Killing an engulfing monster by praying to an angry god
Killing a monster with a deadly poison
Drowing a monster
Sliming a monster
Any golem instant death caused by an attack of yours while polymorphed
Beheading/cutting a monster in half
Cancelling a clay golem

Breaking indirect instadeath (all either under conflict or from a pet)
Monster turning another into a green slime 
Monster stoning another monster
Monster digesting another
Monster killed from digesting a rider
Any golem instant death caused by an attack from another monster

NOTE: Breaking genocide breaks instadeath conduct

Breaking amulets worn:
Wearing any amulet (even if you later take it off)


